00F8B5  2               ; addressing mode table - nybbles provide index into MODE2 table
00F8B5  2               ; for opcodes XXXXXXY0, use XXXXXX as index into table
00F8B5  2               ; for opcodes WWWXXY01  use $40 + XX as index into table
00F8B5  2               ; use right nybble if Y=0; use left nybble if Y=1
